id: pm-jira-create-field-previews
title: Preview required Jira create fields before export
description: "Explicit project and issue type create-contract adaptation with typed SDK and CLI, bounded output, actionable refusals, SDK-backed no-git validation and CI npm/Bun release evidence."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:12:19.246Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T03:57:02.644Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Custom required fields and allowed values validated against revisioned metadata fixtures; Missing answers produce zero POSTs; Diagnostics fit declared byte budget or expose continuation
comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:12:21.477Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check: searched core CLI and pm-jira, pm-linear and pm-github source/docs for createmeta, create-contract and completion previews. Existing Jira transition planning adapts existing-issue transitions only; core schemas describe pm fields. No duplicate create-contract implementation found. Plan: strict revisioned normalized fixture, pure typed compiler, SDK command registration/rendering, optional all-batch export guard, byte-budget continuation, no-git SDK state validation. No new journal or shared mutable state."
  "2026-10-25T23:21:41.223Z",codex-agent,"Implemented strict v1 metadata/answer compiler, typed result/remedy envelopes, SDK-registered preview-create command and opt-in all-create-batch export guard. Targeted tests prove missing answers and a later invalid item cause zero POST/PUT calls. Installed CLI passes JSON/TOON in a real non-git tracker with git absent from PATH. Both new modules measured 100% lines/branches/functions in targeted coverage. Seeded SDK reference-model validation is expanding across direct import, sync, native importer and config importer with replayed older inputs and CRLF/native relationships. No new shared mutable state or journal is introduced."
  "2026-10-25T23:25:40.322Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: disabling only required-field handling in previewJiraCreate makes the targeted revisioned-field test fail (0 pass / 1 fail); disabling only the runExportPush contract guard makes its batch-validation test fail (0 pass / 1 fail). Both functions restored, rebuilt, and the linked pm test run passes all 11 targeted tests. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate (15 files / 76 declarations) and diff whitespace check pass. Seed 0x4a495241 passes 500 sequences / 2000 operations across direct import, sync and both importer adapters, including 40 exact SDK journal-plan refusals with state unchanged. Follow-up pm-jira-atomic-replay-revisions and existing diagnostic item pm-jira-d3tp record that separate limitation."
  "2026-10-25T23:27:22.737Z",codex-agent,"Real-data validation: public unbraind/pm-jira origin/main 84d1cde6211d9330ed659c39a756259e58c2f9c8 copied into a non-git scratch project with 225 source files read-only. Certified SDK reads: 109 items (6 open, 1 in progress, 101 closed, 1 canceled). Revisioned synthetic Team fixture: 109 missing checklists, 109 ready bindings with allowed answer, 109 invalid-choice results; maximum JSON 967 / 4096 bytes. Guarded full batch: 0 POST / 0 PUT. All 225 source-file hashes unchanged; disposable SDK runtime caches excluded. Docs record scope and reproduction inputs. Added escaped-Unicode budget refusal to prevent nonadvancing continuation when a single row cannot fit."
  "2026-10-25T23:28:58.435Z",codex-agent,"Final output accounting includes two-space JSON indentation plus newline: public-corpus maximum is 1260 pretty JSON bytes (967 compact bytes) under 4096. Installed CLI tests also exercise bounded multi-page JSON and TOON. Targeted suite now has 12 tests plus the 500-sequence model test; input/output extreme-value fuzz runs 1000 seeded cases. A peer mutation injected between POST awaits cannot change the already-validated create payload snapshot. No separate lint script is configured; typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate and git diff --check are the local static checks. Full npm and Bun release gates will run on CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-25T23:33:48.168Z",codex-agent,"First CI run 40245077348 measured 100% lines/branches/functions across all six measured modules, but failed one model test because its reference hard-coded the local SDK harness author; CI resolves a different SDK default. Replaced that assumption with the same native SDK author default in the independent reference tracker, while retaining the explicit atomic importer author. Same-tracker replay comparisons now include all timestamps; only cross-tracker comparisons exclude independent clocks. DeepScan identified a test array used only for its length; pagination now asserts actual missing-field identities, choice identities and every bound value. Existing Hound ES5 parser diagnostics remain tracked by pm-jira-92cf."
  "2026-10-25T23:39:44.458Z",codex-agent,"CI release receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/actions/runs/40245424493 passed at fad60793ce1560f8714fa224dbc98b6cfa3a3bf2. Node 22 and Node 26 each pass npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 288 tests / 288 pass / 0 fail / 0 skipped per gate. All six measured runtime source files have 100% lines, branches and functions at unchanged thresholds. Each seeded model run completes 500 sequences / 2000 operations with 40 exact older atomic replay refusals and unchanged SDK state. Tracked health, committed-build drift, SDK differential, docstrings, audits, package contents, changelog and publish-attestation checks pass. DeepScan has zero new findings; CodeQL passes. Automated reviews remain incomplete: CodeRabbit and other reviewers skipped; Hound reports the existing ES5 parser issue (pm-jira-92cf). PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/167 is ready for review; no merge or release performed. This receipt changes no feature code."
  "2026-10-26T02:55:56.963Z",codex-agent,"Read-only review blocks PR 167: a whitespace-only create-contract flag is coerced to absence and can reach POST. Resuming the existing feature item. Audit every command and option reader, centralize present-value validation at the boundary, and property-test absent/empty/space/tab/CRLF/valid variants against a recording fake Jira server. Revert only the shared boundary check to prove the review case fails. Preserve previous feature/real-data evidence; rerun targeted checks and CI npm/Bun gates."
  "2026-10-26T03:14:46.212Z",codex-agent,"Completed all-command option-read audit. One shared option schema validates immutable snapshots before defaults/aliases/I/O across sync, native import/export, legacy jira-sync import, validate, plan-transition, explain-selection and preview-create. All present blank strings (including ignored/secondary aliases, switches, credentials and guards) raise SDK invalid_option usage errors with remedies. Inventory: 60 value bindings plus 8 switches, 94 kebab/camel spellings, 564 absent/empty/spaces/tab/CRLF/valid table cases; all 376 blanks cause zero HTTP calls. Fixed SDK and installed no-git CLI review cases pass. Real fake-server positive controls exposed dropped explicit ports on POST/PUT; both now preserve the selected port like GET."
  "2026-10-26T03:14:53.446Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replaced only parseJiraOptions with the previous blank-to-undefined normalization. The option-table property fails immediately on the fixed whitespace create-contract plus push case (missing expected usage refusal), and the recording TLS server observes exactly 1 HTTP call (POST). Restoring the shared boundary returns 0 fixed-case HTTP calls and passes the table property. Source is restored and rebuilt; no live Jira tenant was contacted."
  "2026-10-26T03:19:37.227Z",codex-agent,"Local follow-up checks pass: node --test test/option-boundary.test.ts (2 tests; 564 table cases; fixed review calls 0), combined boundary/JQL/create CLI regressions (9 tests), npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run docstring (16 files / 79 declarations), and git diff --check. Targeted option-boundary coverage is 100% lines/branches/functions. No standalone lint script is configured. Historical tests expecting blank-to-missing/true or falsy options bags now assert typed usage errors. CLI preview and selection adapters use the same schema; all helpers validate before short-circuiting aliases or switch lists. Await complete npm/Bun CI gates at the pushed head."
  "2026-10-26T03:33:48.290Z",codex-agent,"Resuming PR 167 after corrected review scope: CLI option values alone reject blank strings; exporter payload completeness follows each metadata required flag. Optional labels [] currently block untagged creates. Separate bounded payload shape validation from meaningful required answers; omit optional empty values in preview/export through one shared metadata compiler, add option/user schema support, and property-test both MUST-REFUSE and MUST-ALLOW corpora against recording TLS Jira. Preserve the blank create-contract regression and prior evidence."
  "2026-10-26T03:56:33.972Z",codex-agent,"Corrected scopes implemented: CLI flag values alone use invalid_option blank rejection; payload shape validation permits empty inputs, and required/optional completeness comes solely from metadata.required. Preview and export share compileJiraCreate; optional absent/undefined/null/empty strings/whitespace/arrays are omitted from prepared POST fields, including native labels []. Required empties report missing answers and stop the entire batch. Nonempty values preserve exact contents and choices; zero/false remain meaningful. Added user/accountId and user-array schemas without field-name inference. Prepared wire payload types allow optional omissions while original export plans remain immutable."
  "2026-10-26T03:56:35.097Z",codex-agent,"Both MUST-REFUSE and MUST-ALLOW corpora pass. Seed 0x454d5054 runs 512 random metadata sequences over eight types (string/number/boolean/strings/options/option/user/users), including labels/components/versions and random required flags. 1024 generated MUST-ALLOW POSTs plus the fixed optional-labels untagged export are accepted by an independent recording TLS schema oracle. 512 required-empty and 512 random blank-CLI cases produce zero requests; original blank create-contract fixed case remains covered. All optional empty modes and both roles for each field are covered; SDK readback is unchanged. Targeted suite: 16 tests pass, including the retained 564-case option matrix. Targeted compiler coverage 100% lines/branches/functions; typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate (16 files / 82 declarations) and whitespace checks pass. No standalone lint script is configured."
  "2026-10-26T03:56:36.620Z",codex-agent,"New revert proof: reverting only compileJiraCreate optional-empty handling to the previous nonempty-value rule makes the seeded property fail immediately on the fixed optional-labels untagged-item MUST-ALLOW case. The fake server records 0 POSTs where 1 successful POST is required. Restoring metadata-aware optional omission gives 1 schema-accepted fixed-case POST. The previous boundary revert proof still demonstrates that bypassing CLI validation permits the whitespace create-contract POST. Both classes now have separate refuse/allow coverage; no live Jira tenant was contacted."
